# route-pause-settings.keys: route-stpetersburg.keys to the race, then the pause menu and the
# port's settings pages from it: DISPLAY, back (B) to the pause menu, DRIVING, apply (A), and
# back to the race. Shots at each step. Fresh save (deck-run.sh starts each run with one).
30000 return          # skip the intro FMV
+12000 return         # title: PRESS START -> Gamer Profiles "Welcome to PGR4!"
+8000 space           # Next -> Select Driver
+8000 d 300           # right-hand driver
+1800 space           # -> Select Nationality (United States)
+8000 space           # -> Driver customisation
+8000 space           # Continue -> "Saving content", then Main Menu
+20000 space          # Single Player -> Arcade Mode
+8000 space           # Arcade Mode -> Choose Chapter
+8000 space           # Catch Me If You Can -> Choose Event
+8000 space           # Event 1 Street Race -> car (Sierra Cosworth RS500)
+8000 space           # car -> Choose Difficulty (Silver)
+8000 space           # Silver -> loading, race starts on its own
+20000 mark loaded
+0 e 8000             # full throttle
+0 mark throttle
+5000 mark race
+4000 return          # pause
+3000 mark shot pause
+0 s 100              # down: Continue, Restart, Photo, Options, Sound -> DISPLAY
+1000 s 100
+1000 s 100
+1000 s 100
+1000 s 100
+1500 mark shot pause-display
+0 space              # open DISPLAY
+300 mark shot display-sliding
+3700 mark shot display
+0 backspace          # B: leave unchanged, back to the pause menu
+4000 mark shot pause-again
+0 s 100              # the menu opens on Continue again: down six -> DRIVING
+1000 s 100
+1000 s 100
+1000 s 100
+1000 s 100
+1000 s 100
+1500 mark shot pause-driving
+0 space              # open DRIVING
+4000 mark shot driving
+0 space              # A: apply and save, back to the pause menu
+4000 mark shot pause-saved
+0 return             # continue the race
+4000 mark shot race
